<title>JAPAN: Isolite Insulating - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Isolite Insulating - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.37		vs	    5.63</p>
<p> Operating	  144 million	 vs	  115 million</p>
<p> Current	    140 million	 vs	  111 million</p>
<p> Net		   70 million	 vs	   51 million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.08 yen	  vs	    2.25 yen</p>
<p> Shares		23 million	 vs	   23 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Isolite Insulating Products Co Ltd is a firebrick maker affiliated with Nippon Sheet Glass Co Ltd.</p>
